<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were flat at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate rose one basis point to 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>				  December 17 fix December 16 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.01 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.08 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.31 pct		3.31 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.42 pct		3.41 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
